    ["Can Anirudh Jewels make Custom Diamond Earrings?","Yes. Custom Diamond Earrings can be developed according to the required design, diamond specifications, metal, and customization requirements."],
    ["Does Anirudh Jewels manufacture Diamond Jewelry?","Yes. Anirudh Jewels works with diamond jewelry and provides manufacturing and wholesale solutions for different jewelry requirements."],
    ["Can Diamond Earrings be made for USA buyers?","Yes. Diamond Earrings can be developed for international and USA buyers according to their required designs, specifications, and order requirements."],
    ["Are Wholesale Diamond Earrings available for retailers?","Yes. Wholesale Diamond Earrings can be sourced for retail businesses, jewelry stores, and other B2B buyers depending on order quantity and product requirements."],
    ["Can I order Diamond Earrings in bulk?","Yes. Bulk Diamond Earring orders can be produced based on selected designs, quantities, metal specifications, and diamond requirements."],
    ["Which Diamond Earrings are best for a special gift?","Studs, solitaire earrings, elegant drops, and personalized designs can all work well as gifts. The best option depends on the recipient's style and occasion."],
    ["Are Solitaire Diamond Earrings a classic choice?","Yes. Solitaire Diamond Earrings have a simple design that focuses attention on the individual center diamond, making them a timeless jewelry option."],
    ["Can Diamond Earrings be personalized?","Yes. Personalized Diamond Earrings can include custom shapes, initials, special designs, or specific diamond and metal combinations based on the project."],
    ["What is the difference between Diamond Studs and Diamond Drops?","Diamond studs sit close to the earlobe, while Diamond Drop Earrings extend below the ear. Studs are generally more subtle, whereas drops can create a more noticeable look."],
    ["Which Diamond Earrings are suitable for everyday elegance?","Small studs, huggies, simple hoops, and lightweight designs can provide an elegant appearance while remaining practical for regular wear."],
    ["Can I choose different diamond shapes for Custom Earrings?","Yes. Custom Diamond Earrings can be designed with different diamond shapes such as round, oval, pear, princess, emerald, and other available cuts."],
    ["How should I store my Diamond Earrings?","Keep them in a clean, dry jewelry box or separate jewelry pouch to reduce scratches and contact with other pieces. Store the pair securely when not in use."],
    ["Are Diamond Earrings available in different price ranges?","Yes. Prices can vary significantly based on diamond quality, carat weight, metal, design, craftsmanship, and whether the diamonds are natural or lab grown."],
    ["Where can I find Diamond Earrings for wholesale and custom orders?","You can contact a jewelry manufacturer or wholesale supplier that provides custom production and B2B services. Share your preferred design, quantity, metal, and diamond requirements."],
    ["What should I consider when buying Diamond Earrings for my jewelry business?","For B2B purchases, consider product quality, diamond specifications, metal purity, manufacturing capability, customization, order quantity, pricing, delivery, and supplier communication."]
  ];

  const listEl = document.getElementById('faqList');
  const countEl = document.getElementById('faqCount');
  const emptyEl = document.getElementById('faqEmpty');

  function renderFAQs(items){
    listEl.innerHTML = '';
    items.forEach(([q,a], idx) => {
      const item = document.createElement('div');
      item.className = 'faq-item';
      item.innerHTML = `
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
          <span class="num">${String(idx+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>
          <h3>${q}</h3>
          <span class="faq-toggle"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">${a}</div></div>
      `;
      listEl.appendChild(item);
    });
  }

  function toggleFAQ(header){
    const item = header.parentElement;
    const answer = item.querySelector('.faq-a');
    const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.open').forEach(el => {
      el.classList.remove('open');
      el.querySelector('.faq-a').style.maxHeight = null;
    });
    if(!isOpen){
      item.classList.add('open');
      answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
    }
  }

  function filterFAQs(){
    const term = document.getElementById('faqSearchInput').value.toLowerCase().trim();
    const filtered = term
      ? faqs.filter(([q,a]) => q.toLowerCase().includes(term) || a.toLowerCase().includes(term))
      : faqs;
    renderFAQs(filtered);
    countEl.textContent = term ? `${filtered.length} result${filtered.length!==1?'s':''} found` : `${faqs.length} questions answered`;
    emptyEl.style.display = filtered.length === 0 ? 'block' : 'none';
  }

  renderFAQs(faqs);
  countEl.textContent = `${faqs.length} questions answered`;
</script>
</body>
